2026-10-31T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2382) '- One repository, &{repo("contract-manifest-skateboard", planned: "2-contract")}, default branch `main`, made by `gh repo create` under the `v-sekai-fire-persona` user and given the taskweft manifest's ruleset shape: PR plus merge queue, the six required contexts `manifest-comments`, `manifest-dupes`, `manifest-root`, `manifest-root-shepherd`, `manifest-xml`, `sync-preflight`, never `--admin`.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2382  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2382) '- The manual's Sides paragraph names the new repository as the live goal manifest for the Skateboard and the taskweft one as the goal manifest of everything else.
 # tags: rfd:decision
